@startuml
' drevops/behat-steps - data flow for generating the reference documentation.
' Traced from docs.php constants STEPS_DIRECTORY, TOOLBOX_CLASSES,
' TOOLBOX_CONTEXT, STEPS_FILE, HELPERS_FILE, PAGES_DIRECTORY,
' CONFIGURATION_FILE and functions main, collect_step_traits,
' extract_info, extract_trait_options, extract_trait_prerequisites,
' extract_helpers, collect_helper_methods, file_declares_trait,
' parse_class_comment, parse_method_comment, extract_method_steps,
' method_takes_table, resolve_inherited_comment, validate,
' kind_placeholders, placeholder_precedes_own_noun, step_acronyms,
' rejected_step_phrases, validate_step_patterns,
' extract_step_examples, validate_helpers, validate_titles,
' validate_tags, validate_env_vars, tag_registry, render_info,
' render_step_index, render_step_section, render_step_pages,
' render_helpers, render_helper_index, render_helper_section,
' render_helper_pages, render_trait_prerequisites, render_trait_options,
' render_front_matter, page_section, page_directory, reference_page,
' page_positions, render_page_indexes, relative_link,
' render_extension_options, render_tag_reference, replace_content,
' stale_pages.
' Regenerate every SVG with:  plantuml -tsvg docs/content/architecture/*.puml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam shadowing false
title Data flow: reference documentation generation

participant "ahoy update-docs\nahoy lint-docs" as Dev
participant "docs.php main()" as Main
participant "collect_step_traits()" as Collect
participant "WebContext\nDrupalContext" as Ctx
participant "extract_info()\nextract_helpers()" as Extract
participant "validate()\nvalidate_step_patterns()\nvalidate_helpers()\nvalidate_titles()\nvalidate_tags()\nvalidate_env_vars()" as Validate
participant "render_info()\nrender_helpers()\nrender_page_indexes()\nrender_step_pages()\nrender_helper_pages()\nrender_extension_options()\nrender_tag_reference()" as Render

Dev -> Main: php docs.php [~--fail-on-change]
activate Main
Main -> Main: require build/vendor/autoload.php

Main -> Collect: collect_step_traits([WebContext::class, DrupalContext::class])
activate Collect
Collect -> Ctx: ReflectionClass::getTraits() on each
activate Ctx
Ctx --> Collect: every composed trait
deactivate Ctx
Collect -> Collect: scan src/Steps/<context>/ for files\nthat declare a trait, and match them off
Collect -> Collect: derive Web or Drupal\nfrom the src/Steps subdirectory

alt a trait file was never composed in
  Collect -> Main: throw Exception(not found in the class)
end
Collect --> Main: trait reflections and contexts
deactivate Collect

Main -> Extract: read the members off each trait
activate Extract
Extract -> Extract: vocabulary: public methods prefixed with\nthe trait name that carry a step attribute
Extract -> Extract: toolbox: the other public methods the trait's\nown file declares, minus hooks, transformations\nand anything @internal
Extract -> Extract: add TOOLBOX_CLASSES, whose own public\nmethods carry no trait-name prefix
Extract -> Extract: parse each docblock for the description,\nthe @code example and the @actor tag,\nfollowing {@inheritdoc} to its declaration,\nand each class docblock for its @title
Extract -> Extract: record whether each step takes a table,\nfrom the type of its last parameter
Extract -> Extract: read each trait's option and prerequisite\ndeclarations through ConfigSchemaReader and\nPrerequisiteReader, the readers the runtime uses
Extract --> Main: step info and helper info
note right of Extract
  A malformed declaration throws the
  runtime's own message, and a step with
  no @actor tag throws too, so either
  fails generation instead of being
  documented.
end note
deactivate Extract

Main -> Validate: validate the vocabulary, the toolbox,\nthe tags and the environment
activate Validate
note right of Validate
  A person step opens with "I " and a
  system step does not, only Then uses
  "should" and its method says Assert,
  a step taking a table names "the
  following", a placeholder follows its
  noun unless kind_placeholders() lists
  it, is a descriptive snake_case name
  and never opens the step, a value
  after a verb reads bare, acronyms are
  in capitals, one step attribute per
  method, an example is mandatory and
  must match its own step and no other,
  every published helper needs a
  summary, every trait or class with a
  page needs a @title, tags must match
  tag_registry(), every getenv() name
  must be documented
end note
alt errors found
  Validate --> Main: error list
  Main --> Dev: print errors, exit 1
else clean
  Validate --> Main: no errors
end
deactivate Validate

Main -> Render: render every target
activate Render
Render -> Render: STEPS.md and HELPERS.md: an index per context,\nthen every trait and class in 1 section each
Render -> Render: the site: a section per context for the steps and\nfor the helpers under docs/content/, such as drupal-steps/,\nwith the toolbox among the web helpers, 1 page per\ntrait or class at the path reference_page() builds,\nnamed by its @title, and an index of the section's\npages, both in the title order page_positions() sets
Render -> Render: under each trait's description, its\nPrerequisites table, then its Options table
Render -> Render: write each Source, Example, Steps and\nHelpers link relative to the page holding it,\nthrough relative_link()
Render -> Render: build the option table from the\nBehatStepsExtension config tree\nand the tag table from tag_registry()
Render --> Main: the generated blocks and pages
deactivate Render
Main -> Main: swap each block between its start and end\nmarker in STEPS.md, HELPERS.md, the README.md\nof each section and docs/content/guides/configuration.md
Main -> Main: compare each page with the file on disk, and\nmark a page in a section directory that no trait\nor class renders as stale, through stale_pages()

alt every target is unchanged and no page is stale
  Main --> Dev: exit 0, documentation is up to date
else a target differs, with ~--fail-on-change
  Main --> Dev: exit 1, naming the outdated targets, nothing written
else a target differs, update mode
  Main --> Dev: write the targets that changed,\nand remove the stale pages
end
deactivate Main
@enduml
